Package: MINDS
Type: Package
Title: Mixed-Modal Integrative Clustering with Bayesian MINDS
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("Yinjun", "Zhao", email = "yz3503@cumc.columbia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Yinjun Zhao [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yinjun Zhao <yz3503@cumc.columbia.edu>
Description: Provides the MINDS algorithm for integrative clustering of
    mixed binary and continuous outcomes, plus an example simulated dataset.
    Posterior draws are mapped to an identified (canonical) form, and the
    number of clusters and latent constructs is selected with the complete-data
    deviance information criteria of Celeux et al. (2006)
    <doi:10.1214/06-BA122>.
